{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09269","headline":"经函谷关 · 韦应物","name":"经函谷关","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洪河绝山根，单轨出其侧。\n万古爲要枢，往来何时息。\n秦皇即恃险，海内被吞食。\n及嗣同覆颠，咽喉莫能塞。\n炎灵讵西驾，娄子非经国。\n徒欲扼诸侯，不知恢至德。\n圣朝及天宝，豺虎起东北。\n下沈战死魂，上结穷冤色。\n古今虽共守，成败良可识。\n藩屏无俊贤，金汤独何力。\n[驰]车一登眺，感慨中自恻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}